    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1003">

                <pb facs="0874" n="758" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg758"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.113/250.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-03-25T22:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 25, 1912—10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I have asked representatives of mining companies here to advise me about
                    dynamite, as per your March 24, 7 p.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
